1
00:00:01,917 --> 00:00:05,292
A hospital visit begins before the consultation.

2
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:13,833
Patients still have to manage registration, medical records, and payment.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,875
eGovMed brings those steps into one patient journey.

4
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,333
Sign in through eGovPH using a
mobile number and a one-time code.

5
00:00:36,458 --> 00:00:38,917
Enter the six-digit PIN to continue.

6
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:46,583
The account opens with the
patient profile already available.

7
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:56,333
Describe the concern in everyday
language, including Tagalog.

8
00:01:00,208 --> 00:01:05,125
Here, the patient reports itchy skin
and a rash that began yesterday.

9
00:01:10,583 --> 00:01:14,833
This recorded eGov AI response
suggests Dermatology.

10
00:01:18,042 --> 00:01:20,042
A nurse must confirm the routing.

11
00:01:20,292 --> 00:01:22,083
This is not a diagnosis.

12
00:01:26,792 --> 00:01:30,208
The patient gives consent before
the app opens Face Liveness.

13
00:01:34,375 --> 00:01:39,042
Follow the camera guide and hold still
while the service checks for a live person.

14
00:01:46,375 --> 00:01:52,542
After the check, eGovMed receives the
results and returns to the verified screen.

15
00:01:58,250 --> 00:02:03,000
Choose a hospital, department,
and an available appointment time.

16
00:02:07,167 --> 00:02:11,833
The confirmation includes a booking
reference and an SMS update.

17
00:02:18,458 --> 00:02:21,750
Messages keep the
appointment details easy to find.

18
00:02:28,167 --> 00:02:32,125
Review records from different
facilities in one place.

19
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:40,542
Add a document's details, save the
record, and receive a confirmation.

20
00:02:45,542 --> 00:02:51,167
The backend uses encrypted storage and
fingerprints to check record integrity.

21
00:02:55,417 --> 00:02:59,833
Activate an available benefit,
then review the estimated bill.

22
00:03:05,333 --> 00:03:10,000
Continue to eGovPay and choose
cash payments in the test checkout.

23
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:19,042
For this demo, mark the test payment
as paid and return to the app.

24
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:26,625
The confirmed status
updates the payment record.

25
00:03:30,208 --> 00:03:33,667
Choose a category and
explain what happened.

26
00:03:46,542 --> 00:03:49,958
Verify the phone number using
the code sent by the SMS.

27
00:03:55,583 --> 00:03:59,042
Keep the case reference and
check the report confirmation.

28
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:07,083
The phone sends a request to the eGovMed backend.

29
00:04:11,667 --> 00:04:15,958
The server calls a government service and sends the result back.

30
00:04:20,292 --> 00:04:22,458
Separate adapters handle sign-in,

31
00:04:22,625 --> 00:04:28,458
identity, messages, records, payments, and reporting.

32
00:04:35,417 --> 00:04:40,042
eGovMed, built by Bisaya Hackers for the eGov hackathon.
